{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19728","headline":"早觉有感 · 吕温","name":"早觉有感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东方殊未明，暗室虫正飞。\n先觉忽先起，衣裳颠倒时。\n严冬寒漏长，此夜如何其。\n不用思秉烛，扶桑有清晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}